{"applicationId":"fd6a396e6d214afc8e72ed508724e213","applicationName":"中交路南-出差考勤管理","content":"(function () {\r\n    //获取当前用户\r\n    // var user = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n    // var doc = $.context.getCurrentDocument();\r\n    //应用Id\r\n    var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n\r\n    //获取本月度\r\n    var now = $.date.getCurrentDate();        //当前日期       \r\n    var nowMonth = now.getMonth() - 1;           //当前月     \r\n    var nowYear = now.getYear() + 1900;\r\n    var mongthdays = getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth);//本月天数\r\n\r\n    var monthstartdate = getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth);  //本月起始日期\r\n    var monthEndDate = getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays + 23);//本月结束日期\r\n\r\n    var date = monthstartdate.getTime();\r\n    var date1 = monthEndDate.getTime();\r\n    //接收用户id集合\r\n    var receiveUserIds = $.context.getCurrentUserId();\r\n    //发送站内信\r\n    $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"subject\", date, receiveUserIds);\r\n    $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"subject1\", date1, receiveUserIds);\r\n\r\n\r\n    /*获取员工信息表的所有员工账号集合 */\r\n    var accountList = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    var useridlist = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    var userMap = new Packages.java.util.HashMap();\r\n    var userDocsList = $.form.getFormDocumentsByFieldNameAndValue(applicationId, \"员工信息维护\", userMap);\r\n    // var sizenum = userDocsList.size();//170\r\n    var num = Math.ceil(userDocsList.size() / 100)//2\r\n\r\n    for (var s = 0; s < num; s++) {\r\n        var a = s * 100;\r\n        var b = (s + 1) * 100;\r\n        if (s == Number(num) - 1) {\r\n            var b = userDocsList.size() - a;\r\n            // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"44\", b, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n        }\r\n        if (userDocsList != null && b > 0) {\r\n            for (var f = a; f < b; f++) {\r\n                var userId = userDocsList.get(f).getElementByName(\"姓名\").getValue();\r\n                var user = $.contact.getUserById(userId);\r\n                useridlist.add(userId);\r\n                if (user != null) {\r\n                    var account = user.getAccount().toString();\r\n                    if (accountList.contains(account) == false) {\r\n                        accountList.add(account);\r\n                    }\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        for (var k = 0; k < accountList.size(); k++) {\r\n\r\n\r\n            //表单名称\r\n            var formName4 = \"月报异常记录\";\r\n            //控件值键对\r\n            var filterParamList4 = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n            var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"账号\", \"eq\", accountList.get(k));\r\n            var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"ge\", date);//大于等于\r\n            var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"申请日期\", \"lt\", date1);//小于\r\n            filterParamList4.add(filterParam1);\r\n            filterParamList4.add(filterParam2);\r\n            filterParamList4.add(filterParam3);\r\n            var docS4 = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName4, filterParamList4);\r\n            // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"2\", docS3.size(), $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n    //   useridlist.add(user);\r\n    $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"311\", docS4.size(), $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"322\", userId, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    // // //构建URI\r\n    // var useridlist = [];\r\n    // var useridlist1 = [];\r\n    // //查询人员名单表账号\r\n    // var fieldMap = new Packages.java.util.HashMap();\r\n    // var applicationId = $.context.getCurrentApplicationId();\r\n    // //获取文档集合\r\n    // var userDocsList = $.form.getFormDocumentsByFieldNameAndValue(applicationId, \"员工信息维护\", fieldMap);\r\n    // var a = userDocsList.size();\r\n    // if (a > 100) {\r\n    //     a = 100\r\n    // }\r\n\r\n    // if (userDocsList != null && userDocsList.size() > 0) {\r\n    //     for (var ii = 0; ii < a; ii++) {\r\n    //         var doc2 = userDocsList.get(ii).getId();\r\n    //         var zh = userDocsList.get(ii).getElementByName(\"账号\").getValue();\r\n    //         useridlist.push(doc2);\r\n    //         useridlist1.push(zh)\r\n\r\n    //     }\r\n    // }\r\n\r\n    // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"311\", useridlist, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"322\", useridlist1, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n    // for (var k = 0; k < userDocsList.size(); k++) {\r\n\r\n    //     //表单名称\r\n    //     var formName = \"考勤月报\";\r\n    //     //控件值键对\r\n    //     var filterParamList = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    //     var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"账号\", \"eq\", accountList.get(k));\r\n    //     var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"开始日期\", \"ge\", sTime);//小于等于\r\n    //     // var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"开始日期\", \"lt\", eTime1);//大于\r\n    //     // var filterParam4 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"结束日期\", \"ge\", sTime);//小于等于\r\n    //     // var filterParam5 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"结束日期\", \"lt\", eTime1);//大于\r\n    //     filterParamList.add(filterParam1);\r\n    //     filterParamList.add(filterParam2);\r\n    //     // filterParamList.add(filterParam3);\r\n    //     // filterParamList.add(filterParam4);\r\n    //     // filterParamList.add(filterParam5);\r\n    //     var docS = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName, filterParamList);\r\n    //     $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"2\", docS.size(), $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n    //     //表单名称\r\n    //     var formName1 = \"外出审批单\";\r\n    //     //控件值键对\r\n    //     var filterParamList1 = new Packages.java.util.ArrayList();\r\n    //     var filterParam1 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"账号\", \"eq\",accountList.get(k));\r\n    //     var filterParam2 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"日期1\", \"ge\", sTime);//大于等于\r\n    //     var filterParam3 = new Packages.cn.com.do1.do1cloud.runtime.dto.FilterParam(\"日期1\", \"lt\", eTime);//小于\r\n    //     filterParamList1.add(filterParam1);\r\n    //     filterParamList1.add(filterParam2);\r\n    //     filterParamList1.add(filterParam3);\r\n    //     var docS1 = $.form.getDocumentsByFilterParam(applicationId, formName1, filterParamList1);\r\n    //     $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"1\", docS1.size(), $.context.getCurrentUserId())\r\n\r\n    //     if (docS != null && docS.size() > 0) {\r\n    //         var a = 0;\r\n    //         var b = 0;\r\n    //         $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"1113\", \"a\", $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n    //         if (docS1 != null && docS1.size() > 0) {\r\n    //             $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"3\", \"444444444\", $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    //             for (var g = 0; g < docS1.size(); g++) {\r\n    //                 var wclx = docS1.get(g).getElementByName(\"外出类型\").getValue()\r\n    //                 $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"3\", \"444444444\", $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    //                 if (wclx == \"1\") {\r\n    //                     var wcday = docS1.get(g).getElementByName(\"外出天数\").getValue()\r\n    //                     a += wcday;\r\n    //                     // $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"3\", \"444444444\", $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n    //                 }\r\n    //                 if (wclx == \"2\") {\r\n    //                     var wcday1 = docS1.get(g).getElementByName(\"外出天数\").getValue()\r\n    //                     b += wcday1;\r\n\r\n    //                     $.message.sendGeneralStationMessage(\"4\", b, $.context.getCurrentUserId());\r\n\r\n    //                 }\r\n    //                 docS.get(g).addElement(\"因公外出天数\", a)\r\n    //                 docS.get(g).addElement(\"因私外出天数\", b)\r\n    //                 $.form.saveFormDocument(docS.get(g), applicationId)\r\n\r\n    //             }\r\n\r\n\r\n    //         }\r\n    //         // docS.get(k).addElement(\"因公外出天数\", a)\r\n    //         // docS.get(k).addElement(\"因私外出天数\", b)\r\n    //         // $.form.saveFormDocument(docS.get(k), applicationId)\r\n\r\n\r\n    //     }\r\n\r\n\r\n    // }\r\n\r\n})()\r\n//获得本月的开始日期     \r\nfunction getMonthStartDate(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n    var monthStartDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, 22);\r\n    //转格式\r\n    var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n    //获取日期字符串\r\n    var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthStartDate0, format);\r\n    var monthStartDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n    return monthStartDate;\r\n}\r\n\r\n//获得本月的结束日期     \r\nfunction getMonthEndDate(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays) {\r\n    var monthEndDate0 = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth, mongthdays);\r\n    //转格式\r\n    var format = \"yyyy-MM-dd\";\r\n    //获取日期字符串\r\n    var dateStr = $.date.dateToString(monthEndDate0, format);\r\n    var monthEndDate = $.date.stringToDate(dateStr, format)\r\n    return monthEndDate;\r\n}\r\n\r\n//获取本月总共天数\r\nfunction getMonthDays(nowYear, nowMonth) {\r\n\r\n    var endday = new Date(nowYear, nowMonth + 1, 0);\r\n\r\n    return endday.getDate();\r\n\r\n} \r\n","createTime":1765854149000,"createUserId":"1889706623013949441","customJsId":"","definitionId":"","hiddenCode":"9a119b5f23704532990861d349487ccb","id":"b301343b9c8946348b9ea7eac4a99bee","modelCode":"","modelId":"a2adf27408904b3e83cff0675b6cee9e","modelType":"PC_BUSINESS_DESIGN","namespace":"111111111111","path":"考勤月报列表","status":"NORMAL","tenantId":"9134167922923ba09ad18872b2b1246e","updateTime":1765854149000,"versions":0.0}